  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "A blister pack released quietly at stores such as Target in June 2007, and later sold online, with cosmos holofoil copies of POP Series 3's Flareon, Jolteon and Vaporeon and two booster packs from late EX Series expansions. The three foils had first come one at a time in the Eeveelutions blister packs of late November 2006. None is found in POP Series 3 packs, which held only non-holo copies of the set's rares.",
